### 0. 查询当前用户可访问的知识库列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kb
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### 1. 创建知识库
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kb
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "技术文档库",
  "description": "团队技术规范",
  "departmentId": "TECH",
  "isPublic": false
}

### 2. 上传文档
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kb/1/documents
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="hr-handbook.txt"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./hr-handbook.txt
--WebAppBoundary--

### 3. 查询索引状态
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kb/1/documents/1/status
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### 4. 查询文档列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kb/1/documents
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### 5. 下载原始文件
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kb/1/documents/4/download
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### 6. 重建索引
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kb/1/documents/1/reindex
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### 7. 删除文档
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kb/1/documents/1
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### 8. 查询任务状态
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/kb/1/documents/6/status
Authorization: Bearer <token>